          "fill": "#222222",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Radio group uses full labels; no default widening. Existing source is backed up privately. Selecting Only me narrows reuse via existing impact/status 66; it is never an ordinary unchecked save. Expansion rechecks active membership, grants and audience. Batch entry uses two selected owned sources. Direct single-source entry shows one item and omits the unchanged photo at R02.",
