          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Owner-only edit proposal; coauthor/publisher sees playback and review-required label, no save control. Preserve original transcript, recording, source language and offset provenance. No new coauthor transcript-writing authority. Unsupported language/playback failure keeps text and original; do not mark reviewed without listening. Focus field; buttons remain reachable above keyboard (R20).",
