          "name": "Rights and recovery",
          "fill": "#222222",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Actor variants never switch identity in the UI. Repair link checks current coauthor capability and exact source/placement identity. Owner grant alternative remains owner-controlled R01; no navigation that grants another owner’s rights.",
