          "fill": "#222222",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Candidate supporting-source inspector may reuse first-flow 55 composition only under candidate authorization, never public URL or source R14. Return restores Learn card/offset. Explicit voice exclusion is review annotation/candidate review copy, never shown as a private teaser in public reader.",
